# GharBench secrets. Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in what you need.
#
# `pnpm smoke` needs NONE of these — it is offline and costs $0.
# Only `pnpm smoke:live --model=<provider/model>` reads this file.
#
# A blank key is not an error: resolveModel() only throws for the provider you
# actually name on the command line, so one key is enough to run.


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Gate G1 — "a repeated call demonstrably bills cached input"
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Either of these closes G1's outstanding clause.
#
#   OpenAI — caches automatically on prefixes >=1,024 tokens (TTL ~5-10 min).
#   The probe makes up to 4 identical calls and stops at the first cache read.
#   A miss is reported as INCONCLUSIVE, not as a proven defect.
#
#     pnpm smoke:live --model=openai/gpt-4.1-mini
#
#   Anthropic — we place the breakpoint, so call 1 writes and call 2 reads.
#   Two calls, no retries, unambiguous. The stronger witness for the gate.
#
#     pnpm smoke:live --model=anthropic/claude-haiku-4-5
#
# A ChatGPT Plus/Pro subscription is NOT an API key — it grants no API access.

OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GOOGLE_GENERATIVE_AI_API_KEY=


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Cache reporting unverified — conversations yes, cache probe no
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Reached via createOpenAI({ baseURL }). They run the conversation fine, but
# the probe skips them unless you pass --force-cache-check. If a forced probe
# reports cache reads, set `reportsCacheReads: true` for that provider in
# src/providers/registry.ts.

XAI_API_KEY=
MISTRAL_API_KEY=
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
MOONSHOT_API_KEY=
DEEPINFRA_API_KEY=
FIREWORKS_API_KEY=
GROQ_API_KEY=
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=


# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# There are no other environment variables
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The harness reads nothing from env except the keys above (via
# ProviderSpec.envKey). Run shape is command-line only:
#
#   --model=<provider/model>   contestant; required
#   --buyer-model=<ref>        defaults to --model
#   --max-steps=N              defaults to scenario.maxSteps (100)
#   --no-cache-check           skip the cache probe
#   --force-cache-check        probe a provider whose reporting is unverified
#
# Scenario, persona, seed and temperatures live in the fixtures, not here:
# they are part of the reproducibility manifest, and a run whose parameters can
# be silently changed by a shell variable is not reproducible.
